	(text "In superimposed access the Window's cycle reads a character word: IC44 / IC45 take its two codes and IC46 the\nraster line as dot 4 begins (WCK, IC41/A). The left code addresses the character generator IC47 for the rest\nof the cycle, the right one through the next (WPH, IC41/B); IC48 loads the 8 dots at each cycle's end and\nshifts them out as TDOT. CUD1, CUD2 and FONT2 are address lines of IC47: the cursor and a second font." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d87389a5-3d7a-5683-8f99-bca89581a446"))
